ate.webp\" width=\"960\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Emotional Support</span><h3>How to Cheer Up Your Girlfriend When She Is Sad or Having a Bad Day</h3><p>Learn supportive ways to comfort your girlfriend when she feels sad, stressed or overwhelmed—without dismissing her feelings or forcing positivity.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>8 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"how to support your partner during stress: practical and emotional ways to help learn how to support a stressed partner by listening, asking what help is wanted, sharing practical tasks and respecting boundaries. how to support your partner during stress how to help a stressed girlfriend support partner through difficult time emotional support in relationship emotional support\" href=\"/guides/how-to-support-your-partner-during-stress/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Wishly A Note of Gratitude thank-you template preview\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/a-note-of-gratitude.webp\" width=\"960\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Emotional Support</span><h3>How to Support Your Partner During Stress: Practical and Emotional Ways to Help</h3><p>Learn how to support a stressed partner by listening, asking what help is wanted, sharing practical tasks and respecting boundaries.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>8 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"what to do when your partner needs space: respectful ways to respond understand how to respond when your partner asks for space, agree on communication, manage uncertainty and reconnect without pressure. what to do when your partner needs space girlfriend needs space what should i do how to give partner space in relationship respecting space in a relationship emotional support\" href=\"/guides/what-to-do-when-your-partner-needs-space/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Wishly Miss You Letter template preview\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/miss-you-letter-template.webp\" width=\"960\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Emotional Support</span><h3>What to Do When Your Partner Needs Space: Respectful Ways to Respond</h3><p>Understand how to respond when your partner asks for space, agree on communication, manage uncertainty and reconnect without pressure.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>8 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a></div><div class=\"article-callout\"><h3>Make a thoughtful moment shareable</h3><p>Explore Wishly's templates and customise a personal website with your own text and photos.</p><a class=\"premium-button premium-button-primary\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/templates/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Browse Wishly templates →</a></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer hp-foot\">\n<div class=\"premium-container\">\n<div class=\"hp-foot-row footer-main-row\">\n<div class=\"hp-foot-brand\">\n<a aria-label=\"Wishly Guide home\" class=\"brand-lockup brand\" href=\"/\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"brand-mark\">✦</span><span class=\"brand-lockup-copy\"><b>Wishly</b><small>GUIDE · CREATE MOMENTS</small></span>\n</a>\n<p>Ideas, practical tutorials and clear answers for creating personal websites that make life’s special moments feel even more memorable.</p>\n<a class=\"premium-button premium-button-ghost footer-main-cta\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Main Wishly website ↗</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-link-group\"><h4>Explore</h4><a href=\"/guides/\">All guides</a><a href=\"/topics/love-and-romance/\">Love &amp; romance</a><a href=\"/topics/emotional-support/\">Emotional support</a><a href=\"/topics/communication-and-repair/\">Communication &amp; repair</a><a href=\"/topics/long-distance-relationships/